  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/compatible_with-26.1_|_1.21_|_1.20_|_1.19_|_1.18_|_1.17_|_1.16-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"468\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<h1><strong>更好的燈籠 v1.3</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>現已相容新增的銅燈籠與鏈條！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此資源包為<strong>燈籠</strong>&nbsp;與<strong>鏈條</strong>&nbsp;新增了<strong>3D 模型</strong>&nbsp;，並帶來耳目一新的外觀。此外，它還調整了<strong>第三人稱</strong>&nbsp;視角下<strong>手持</strong>&nbsp;燈籠的姿勢，讓畫面更協調且更具真實感。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/614/321/huge_2023-01-29_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/436/2025-09-30_20-02-52-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/711/589/huge_2023-01-29_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<h2><strong>🌟模組相容性（1.2 版及以上適用）</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width:23.6842%;border-width:1px\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong>模組</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\"><strong>1.20</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\"><strong>1.21</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong><a rel=\"nofollow\">奧術燈籠</a></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong><a rel=\"nofollow\">薄霧</a></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>🔻1.2 版及舊版</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/compatible_with-1.21_|_1.20_|_1.19_|_